# Lumberjack gathering with self recovery, independent Tracking setup and one automatic Recall attempt.
# Needs: Hatchets, bandages, reagents, recovery hotkeys. Automatic Recall needs a charged book with a Home rune.
# Tracking setup runs once per Play when use_tracking is on, regardless of auto_recall.
# For Tracking-triggered Recall, set Hunt Frequency to Always Get Closest in the Tracking window.
# Design and in-game checks: blueprint/lumberjack-pvp-handbook.html part 8.
# Hotkeys: Bandage Self, Drink Cure, Drink Heal, Drink Refresh,
#          > Smart Heal/Cure Self, > Greater Heal/Cure Self, > Interrupt, Cancel Current Target.
# Optional cooldown bars: heal pot, walk, reflect. A missing walk or reflect bar cannot
# protect a cast from movement or reject an early Reflect retry. Check the active character.
# Warmode and an existing cursor belong to the player. Gathering and self buffs stand down.
# No attack, TK, summons, Meditation or automatic PvP-script switch belongs to this loop.
# A Recall decision stops gathering until this script is restarted. Sending Recall is not arrival.
# This script casts RecallCharge to Home. It does not walk to or enter a moongate.
# Server-event overheads and manual Tracking displays stay in the profile.
# The server blocks harvest for 60 seconds after Recall, Moongate, Hike, Teleport or Rope.
# The profile displays recent-travel refusals. The script does not read that message or restart the delay.
# The 2-second harvest retry only spaces attempts. It cannot shorten the server travel restriction.

clearall
clearsysmsg
cleardragdrop
clearignore

if pvp
    overhead "[ script, blocked ]" 53
    stop
endif

# ####################################################################################
# # CONFIG
# ####################################################################################
@setvar! config__chatty 1
@setvar! config__use_potions 1

# Automatic Recall only. 0 skips its detection reads, book checks and weight decisions.
# use_tracking controls startup setup. The profile displays any server Tracking messages.
@setvar! config__auto_recall 1

# Tracking setup is independent of auto_recall and runs once before the loop.
@setvar! config__use_tracking 1

# Recall on a Tracking report within 1 through 45 steps. Requires auto_recall and use_tracking.
@setvar! config__recall_on_detection 1

# Tracking color: 1 red (murderer), 2 grey (criminal), 3 orange (enemy), 4 all three.
# Grey here means Criminal Players. The profile displays server Tracking messages.
@setvar! config__tracking_color 1
@setvar! config__show_tracking 0

@setvar! config__recall_at_any_distance 0
@setvar! config__recall_on_weight 1
@setvar! config__weight_remaining 10
# When automatic Recall is on, pause harvest if no Recall book is available.
@setvar! config__require_runebook 1

# Warn about spare tools independently of automatic Recall.
@setvar! config__low_hatchets 2

# Missing hit points, rather than absolute HP. Bandages handle ordinary damage.
@setvar! config__heal_hits 35
@setvar! config__emergency_hits 45
@setvar! config__light_hits 15
@setvar! config__refresh_stam 15
@setvar! config__mana_heal 4
@setvar! config__mana_cure 6
@setvar! config__mana_greater_heal 11
@setvar! config__mana_recall 11

# Keep the handbook's 20 mana GH + Teleport budget after a preparation buff.
@setvar! config__use_reactive_armor 1
@setvar! config__use_magic_reflect 1
@setvar! config__mana_reactive_armor 24
@setvar! config__mana_magic_reflect 34

# Opt in at home. Persistent serials are picked once, never hardcoded or erased in the field.
@setvar! config__close_house_door 0
@setvar! config__open_door_graphic 1712
@setvar! config__deposit_at_stockpile 0

# ####################################################################################
# # WAIT AND COOLDOWN
# ####################################################################################
@setvar! wait__short 200
@setvar! wait__poll 100
@setvar! wait__target 1000

@setvar! cooldown__message 3000
@setvar! cooldown__housekeeping 5000
@setvar! cooldown__reagents 30000
@setvar! cooldown__food 60000

@setvar! cooldown__bandage_retry 1200
@setvar! cooldown__potion_retry 1000
@setvar! cooldown__heal_retry 2500
@setvar! cooldown__buff_retry 10000
@setvar! cooldown__harvest_retry 2000

@setvar! cooldown__recall_scan 5000
@setvar! cooldown__recall_response 5000
@setvar! cooldown__stockpile 10000

# ####################################################################################
# # TIMER
# ####################################################################################
# Retry clocks are made ready on startup. Recall requests remain single-attempt.
if not timerexists "timer__message"
    createtimer "timer__message"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__housekeeping"
    createtimer "timer__housekeeping"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__reagents"
    createtimer "timer__reagents"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__food"
    createtimer "timer__food"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__bandage"
    createtimer "timer__bandage"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__cure_potion"
    createtimer "timer__cure_potion"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__heal_potion"
    createtimer "timer__heal_potion"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__refresh"
    createtimer "timer__refresh"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__heal"
    createtimer "timer__heal"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__buff"
    createtimer "timer__buff"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__harvest"
    createtimer "timer__harvest"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__recall_scan"
    createtimer "timer__recall_scan"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__recall"
    createtimer "timer__recall"
endif

if not timerexists "timer__stockpile"
    createtimer "timer__stockpile"
endif

settimer "timer__message" cooldown__message
settimer "timer__housekeeping" cooldown__housekeeping
settimer "timer__reagents" cooldown__reagents
settimer "timer__food" cooldown__food
settimer "timer__bandage" cooldown__bandage_retry
settimer "timer__cure_potion" cooldown__potion_retry
settimer "timer__heal_potion" cooldown__potion_retry
settimer "timer__refresh" cooldown__potion_retry
settimer "timer__heal" cooldown__heal_retry
settimer "timer__buff" cooldown__buff_retry
settimer "timer__harvest" cooldown__harvest_retry
settimer "timer__recall_scan" cooldown__recall_scan
settimer "timer__recall" 0
settimer "timer__stockpile" cooldown__stockpile

# ####################################################################################
# # STATE
# ####################################################################################
# 1 only on a pass that ran housekeeping. Poll reagent errors at that pass's end, after Tracking.
@setvar! var__housekeeping_pass 0

# Recall decision: 0 keep gathering, 1 stop optional work and attempt Recall when input is free.
# Detection or low spare weight sets this to 1. Only restarting the script resets it.
@setvar! var__recall_needed 0

# 1 after sending RecallCharge. Prevents repeated Recall commands, including after a failure.
@setvar! var__recall_sent 0

# 1 after showing a server refusal or the 5-second result-check notice. Does not prove arrival.
@setvar! var__recall_notice_shown 0

# Own-book presence, refreshed every 5 seconds before automatic Recall is sent.
# Initial 0 keeps book-required gathering paused until the first inventory check.
@setvar! var__recall_book_available 0

# Last verified equipped Hatchet serial. 0 means no verified tool yet.
@setvar! var__hatchet 0
# 1 only after checking the equipped hand this harvest attempt. A dclick alone is not proof.
@setvar! var__hatchet_equipped 0

# 1 after the server confirms the configured hunt color during startup.
@setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 0
# 1 if Hunting was active at startup or the last Recall scan. No repeated gump setup in the loop.
@setvar! var__tracking_hunting_active 0
# Temporary button-response flag. Wait for each response before cycling the next filter.
@setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 0

# 1 if the most recent bandage search found a bandage. 0 permits the light-Heal fallback.
@setvar! var__bandage_available 0
# This pass's healing choice: 0 none, 1 Smart Heal/Cure Self, 2 Greater Heal/Cure Self.
@setvar! var__heal_spell 0

# Own reagent presence: 0 missing, 1 found. Housekeeping refreshes these every 30 seconds.
@setvar! var__garlic 0
@setvar! var__ginseng 0
@setvar! var__mandrake 0
@setvar! var__ash 0
@setvar! var__silk 0

# Spell recipe availability: 1 only when all required reagents were found in the same refresh.
@setvar! var__regs_heal 0
@setvar! var__regs_cure 0
@setvar! var__regs_greater_heal 0
@setvar! var__regs_reactive_armor 0
@setvar! var__regs_reflect 0
# 1 when this pass issued a self-buff cast. Starts its retry clock and bounded cast wait.
@setvar! var__buff_cast 0

if config__close_house_door = 1 and not varexist global__my_house_door
    overhead "[ door, pick ]" 55
    setvar global__my_house_door
endif

if config__deposit_at_stockpile = 1 and not varexist global__my_resource_stockpile
    overhead "[ stockpile, pick ]" 55
    setvar global__my_resource_stockpile
endif

sysmsg "Lumberjack enhanced v4 loaded: auto recall={{config__auto_recall}}, tracking color={{config__tracking_color}}." 88
if config__chatty = 1
    overhead "[ lumberjack, on ]" 90
endif

# ####################################################################################
# # TRACKING SETUP
# ####################################################################################
# Set the selected color and Hunting once, even when automatic Recall is off.
# A failed setup requires a restart. No danger decision belongs in this setup.
if config__use_tracking = 1 and skill "Tracking" > 0
    if diffhits < config__heal_hits and not poisoned and not warmode
        if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
            # Discard a previous selection's confirmation before sending a new response.
            if insysmsg "You will now hunt"
                # No blanket journal clear belongs here.
            endif
            useskill "Tracking"
            waitforgump 4267467659 wait__target
            @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 0

            if gumpexists 4267467659
                # Button 8 cycles ten hunt filters. Bound the attempt to one complete rotation.
                for 10
                    if diffhits >= config__heal_hits or poisoned or warmode or hidden or queued or casting or targetexists
                        break
                    endif
                    if not gumpexists 4267467659
                        break
                    endif
                    gumpresponse 8 4267467659
                    @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 0
                    # Only one selection is outstanding. Do not outrun a delayed server response.
                    for 60
                        if diffhits >= config__heal_hits or poisoned or warmode or hidden or queued or casting or targetexists
                            break
                        endif
                        if config__tracking_color = 1
                            if insysmsg "You will now hunt murderer players"
                                @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                                @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 1
                                break
                            endif
                        elseif config__tracking_color = 2
                            if insysmsg "You will now hunt criminal players"
                                @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                                @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 1
                                break
                            endif
                        elseif config__tracking_color = 3
                            if insysmsg "You will now hunt enemy players"
                                @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                                @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 1
                                break
                            endif
                        elseif config__tracking_color = 4
                            if insysmsg "You will now hunt all hostile players"
                                @setvar! var__tracking_filter_confirmed 1
                                @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 1
                                break
                            endif
                        endif
                        if insysmsg "You will now hunt"
                            @setvar! var__tracking_button_answered 1
                            break
                        endif
                        wait wait__poll
                    endfor
                    if var__tracking_filter_confirmed = 1 or var__tracking_button_answered = 0
                        break
                    endif
                endfor

                if var__tracking_filter_confirmed = 1 and gumpexists 4267467659 and diffhits < config__heal_hits and not poisoned and not warmode and not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
                    # Button 6 toggles Hunting. Keep an already active mode on.
                    if not findbuff "tracking"
                        gumpresponse 6 4267467659
                        wait wait__short
                    endif
                    if findbuff "tracking"
                        @setvar! var__tracking_hunting_active 1
                    endif
                    if config__show_tracking = 0
                        gumpclose 4267467659
                    endif
                elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                    overhead "[ track, miss ]" 53
                    settimer "timer__message" 0
                endif
            elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ track, miss ]" 53
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif
endif

# ####################################################################################
# # MAIN LOOP
# ####################################################################################
while not dead
    # The pvp expression means structured-PvP restrictions, not a field PK encounter.
    if pvp
        overhead "[ script, blocked ]" 53
        stop
    endif

    @setvar! var__housekeeping_pass 0

    # ####################################################################################
    # # SURVIVAL
    # ####################################################################################
    # No unbounded casting drain. Manual casts and cursors block actions, not state reads.
    # PARALYSIS: use a trapped pouch before other recovery.
    if paralyzed
        if findtype 3705 backpack 38
            yell "[Pouch"
            wait wait__short
        elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
            overhead "[ pouch, out ]" 53
            settimer "timer__message" 0
        endif
    endif

    # CURE: potions first, then select the self-healing agent if reagents permit.
    @setvar! var__heal_spell 0
    if poisoned and config__use_potions = 1
        if timer "timer__cure_potion" >= cooldown__potion_retry
            if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
                if findtype "Orange Potion" self
                    hotkey "Drink Cure"
                    settimer "timer__cure_potion" 0
                    wait wait__short
                elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                    overhead "[ cure pot, out ]" 53
                    settimer "timer__message" 0
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    if poisoned and var__regs_cure = 1 and mana >= config__mana_cure
        @setvar! var__heal_spell 1
    endif

    # BANDAGE: ordinary recovery, with no restart while a bandage is running.
    if diffhits > 0 or poisoned
        if not bandaging and skill "Healing" > 0
            if timer "timer__bandage" >= cooldown__bandage_retry
                if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
                    @setvar! var__bandage_available 0
                    if findtype 3617 self
                        @setvar! var__bandage_available 1
                        hotkey "Bandage Self"
                        settimer "timer__bandage" 0
                        wait wait__short
                    elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                        overhead "[ bandage, out ]" 53
                        settimer "timer__message" 0
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # HEAL POTION: check both the bar and the potion label.
    if diffhits >= config__heal_hits and not poisoned and config__use_potions = 1
        if cooldown "heal pot" = 0 and timer "timer__heal_potion" >= cooldown__potion_retry
            if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
                if findtype "Yellow Potion" self as alias__heal_potion
                    getlabel alias__heal_potion label__heal_potion
                    if "next usable" in label__heal_potion
                        # The label remains authoritative when the heal pot bar is missing.
                    else
                        hotkey "Drink Heal"
                        settimer "timer__heal_potion" 0
                        wait wait__short
                    endif
                elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                    overhead "[ heal pot, out ]" 53
                    settimer "timer__message" 0
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # HEALING SPELL: stronger recovery takes priority over a light Heal.
    if diffhits >= config__emergency_hits and not poisoned and var__regs_greater_heal = 1 and mana >= config__mana_greater_heal
        @setvar! var__heal_spell 2
    elseif diffhits >= config__light_hits and not poisoned and not bandaging
        if var__regs_heal = 1 and mana >= config__mana_heal
            if skill "Healing" = 0 or var__bandage_available = 0
                @setvar! var__heal_spell 1
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # SELF AGENT: bound the cast wait and leave existing manual casts alone.
    if var__heal_spell != 0 and not warmode
        if timer "timer__heal" >= cooldown__heal_retry
            if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists and cooldown "walk" = 0
                if var__heal_spell = 2
                    hotkey "> Greater Heal/Cure Self"
                else
                    hotkey "> Smart Heal/Cure Self"
                endif
                settimer "timer__heal" 0
                wait wait__short
                for 60
                    if not casting
                        break
                    endif
                    wait wait__poll
                endfor
                if targetexists and diffhits = 0 and not poisoned
                    hotkey "Cancel Current Target"
                    wait wait__short
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # STAMINA: use Refresh only when the input window is free.
    if stam <= config__refresh_stam and config__use_potions = 1
        if timer "timer__refresh" >= cooldown__potion_retry
            if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
                if findtype "Red Potion" backpack
                    hotkey "Drink Refresh"
                    settimer "timer__refresh" 0
                    wait wait__short
                elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                    overhead "[ refresh, out ]" 53
                    settimer "timer__message" 0
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ####################################################################################
    # # HOUSEKEEPING
    # ####################################################################################
    # Slow inventory reads share the housekeeping clock.
    # Reagent shortages are marked after Recall detection, then refreshed here.
    if timer "timer__housekeeping" >= cooldown__housekeeping
        settimer "timer__housekeeping" 0
        @setvar! var__housekeeping_pass 1

        # REAGENTS: refresh presence once, then derive each spell recipe.
        if timer "timer__reagents" >= cooldown__reagents
            settimer "timer__reagents" 0

            @setvar! var__garlic 0
            @setvar! var__ginseng 0
            @setvar! var__mandrake 0
            @setvar! var__ash 0
            @setvar! var__silk 0

            if findtype 3972 self
                @setvar! var__garlic 1
            endif

            if findtype 3973 self
                @setvar! var__ginseng 1
            endif

            if findtype 3974 self
                @setvar! var__mandrake 1
            endif

            if findtype 3980 self
                @setvar! var__ash 1
            endif

            if findtype 3981 self
                @setvar! var__silk 1
            endif

            @setvar! var__regs_heal 0
            @setvar! var__regs_cure 0
            @setvar! var__regs_greater_heal 0
            @setvar! var__regs_reactive_armor 0
            @setvar! var__regs_reflect 0

            if var__garlic = 1 and var__ginseng = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_cure 1
            endif

            if var__garlic = 1 and var__ginseng = 1 and var__silk = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_heal 1
            endif

            if var__garlic = 1 and var__ginseng = 1 and var__silk = 1 and var__mandrake = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_greater_heal 1
            endif

            if var__garlic = 1 and var__silk = 1 and var__ash = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_reactive_armor 1
            endif

            if var__garlic = 1 and var__silk = 1 and var__mandrake = 1
                @setvar! var__regs_reflect 1
            endif
        endif

        # TOOLS: warn without affecting the automatic Recall setting.
        if counttype "hatchet" backpack <= config__low_hatchets
            if timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ hatchet, low ]" 53
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif
        endif

        # FOOD: skip optional work once a Recall decision is latched.
        if var__recall_needed = 0 and diffhits < config__light_hits
            if timer "timer__food" >= cooldown__food
                if not poisoned and not warmode and not findbuff "Food Satisfaction"
                    if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
                        settimer "timer__food" 0
                        if findtype tray backpack as alias__food
                            dclick alias__food
                            wait wait__short
                        endif
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif

        # HOUSE DOOR: act only on the persistent door selected before the loop.
        if config__close_house_door = 1 and var__recall_needed = 0
            if diffhits < config__light_hits and not poisoned and not warmode
                if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
                    if findtype config__open_door_graphic ground -1 -1 2 as alias__open_door
                        if alias__open_door = global__my_house_door
                            dclick alias__open_door
                            wait wait__short
                        endif
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif

        # STOCKPILE: keep its cursor separate from manual actions.
        if config__deposit_at_stockpile = 1 and var__recall_needed = 0
            if timer "timer__stockpile" >= cooldown__stockpile
                if diffhits < config__light_hits and not poisoned and not warmode
                    if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists
                        if find global__my_resource_stockpile ground -1 -1 2
                            if findtype 7133|7127 backpack
                                settimer "timer__stockpile" 0
                                menu global__my_resource_stockpile 0
                                waitfortarget wait__target

                                if targetexists
                                    target self
                                    wait wait__short
                                endif

                                if targetexists
                                    hotkey "Cancel Current Target"
                                endif
                            endif
                        endif
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ####################################################################################
    # # SELF BUFFS
    # ####################################################################################
    # Self buffs leave the GH + Teleport mana budget and yield to manual actions.
    if var__recall_needed = 0 and diffhits < config__light_hits
        if not poisoned and not warmode and timer "timer__buff" >= cooldown__buff_retry
            if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists and cooldown "walk" = 0
                @setvar! var__buff_cast 0
                if config__use_reactive_armor = 1 and not findbuff "Reactive Armor" and var__regs_reactive_armor = 1 and mana >= config__mana_reactive_armor
                    cast "Reactive Armor"
                    @setvar! var__buff_cast 1
                elseif config__use_magic_reflect = 1 and not findbuff "Magic Reflection" and cooldown "reflect" = 0 and var__regs_reflect = 1 and mana >= config__mana_magic_reflect
                    cast "Magic Reflection"
                    @setvar! var__buff_cast 1
                endif

                if var__buff_cast = 1
                    settimer "timer__buff" 0
                    wait wait__short
                    for 60
                        if not casting
                            break
                        endif
                        if diffhits >= config__heal_hits or poisoned
                            hotkey "> Interrupt"
                            break
                        endif
                        wait wait__poll
                    endfor
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ####################################################################################
    # # SMART HARVEST
    # ####################################################################################
    # A Recall decision pauses harvest. Actual full weight also prevents harvesting when Recall is off.
    if var__recall_needed = 0 and diffweight > 0
        # A configured Recall book is required only for automatic-Recall gathering.
        if config__auto_recall = 0 or config__require_runebook = 0 or var__recall_book_available = 1
            # Require verified Hunting only if Tracking-triggered automatic Recall is enabled.
            if config__auto_recall = 0 or config__recall_on_detection = 0 or config__use_tracking = 0 or var__tracking_hunting_active = 1
                if diffhits < config__heal_hits and not poisoned and not paralyzed and not warmode
                    if timer "timer__harvest" >= cooldown__harvest_retry
                        if not hidden and not queued and not casting and not targetexists and cooldown "walk" = 0
                            # Verify the equipped slot instead of assuming a previous dclick worked.
                            @setvar! var__hatchet_equipped 0
                            if findlayer self lefthand as alias__left_hand
                                if var__hatchet = alias__left_hand
                                    @setvar! var__hatchet_equipped 1
                                else
                                    getlabel alias__left_hand label__left_hand
                                    if "hatchet" in label__left_hand
                                        @setvar! var__hatchet alias__left_hand
                                        @setvar! var__hatchet_equipped 1
                                    endif
                                endif
                            endif

                            settimer "timer__harvest" 0
                            if var__hatchet_equipped = 1
                                dclick var__hatchet
                                wait wait__short

                                if targetexists
                                    overhead "[ harvest, cursor ]" 53
                                endif
                            elseif findtype 3907|3908 backpack as alias__spare_hatchet
                                dclick alias__spare_hatchet
                                wait wait__short
                                # Check the newly equipped slot on the next pass.
                            elseif timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                                overhead "[ hatchet, out ]" 53
                                settimer "timer__message" 0
                            endif
                        endif
                    endif
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif

    # ####################################################################################
    # # AUTO RECALL
    # ####################################################################################
    # This entire path is skipped when automatic Recall is disabled.
    if config__auto_recall = 1
        # Until the one Recall attempt, check books and Hunting on their own slow clock.
        if var__recall_sent = 0 and timer "timer__recall_scan" >= cooldown__recall_scan
            if config__recall_on_detection = 1 and config__use_tracking = 1
                @setvar! var__tracking_hunting_active 0
                if var__tracking_filter_confirmed = 1 and findbuff "tracking"
                    @setvar! var__tracking_hunting_active 1
                endif

                if var__tracking_hunting_active = 0 and timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                    overhead "[ track, check ]" 55
                    settimer "timer__message" 0
                endif
            endif

            @setvar! var__recall_book_available 0
            if findtype "runebook" backpack or findtype "runetome" backpack
                @setvar! var__recall_book_available 1
            elseif config__require_runebook = 1 and timer "timer__message" >= cooldown__message
                overhead "[ runebook, out ]" 53
                settimer "timer__message" 0
            endif
        endif

        # Read Tracking before any other journal lookup. Profile overheads display it.
        if config__recall_on_detection = 1 and config__use_tracking = 1
            if var__tracking_hunting_active = 1 and var__recall_needed = 0
                if config__recall_at_any_distance = 1
                    if insysmsg "Now tracking:" or insysmsg "Distance to destination:" or insysmsg "spaces to target"
                        @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
                    endif
                else
                    # Keep all 45 literal distance branches. No player find is needed.
                    if insysmsg "Distance to destination: 45 steps" or insysmsg "(45 spaces to target)"
                        @setvar! var__recall_needed 1
